weight: copying from a non-meta parameter in the checkpoint to a meta parameter in the current model, which is a no-op. (Did you mean to pass `assign=True` to assign items in the state dictionary to their corresponding key in the module instead of copying them in place?)\n","  warnings.warn(\n","/usr/local/lib/python3.12/dist-packages/torch/nn/modules/module.py:2441: UserWarning: for layer4.2.bn3.bias: copying from a non-meta parameter in the checkpoint to a meta parameter in the current model, which is a no-op. (Did you mean to pass `assign=True` to assign items in the state dictionary to their corresponding key in the module instead of copying them in place?)\n","  warnings.warn(\n","Some weights of the model checkpoint at facebook/detr-resnet-50 were not used when initializing DetrForObjectDetection: ['model.backbone.conv_encoder.model.layer1.0.downsample.1.num_batches_tracked', 'model.backbone.conv_encoder.model.layer2.0.downsample.1.num_batches_tracked', 'model.backbone.conv_encoder.model.layer3.0.downsample.1.num_batches_tracked', 'model.backbone.conv_encoder.model.layer4.0.downsample.1.num_batches_tracked']\n","- This IS expected if you are initializing DetrForObjectDetection from the checkpoint of a model trained on another task or with another architecture (e.g. initializing a BertForSequenceClassification model from a BertForPreTraining model).\n","- This IS NOT expected if you are initializing DetrForObjectDetection from the checkpoint of a model that you expect to be exactly identical (initializing a BertForSequenceClassification model from a BertForSequenceClassification model).\n"]},{"output_type":"stream","name":"stdout","text":["ℹ️ Variable 'im' no encontrada. Carga una imagen PIL en 'im' y vuelve a ejecutar esta celda.\n"]}],"source":["# === Celda inteligente: LLM privado -> fallback a detección (DETR) ===\n","!pip -q install -U transformers huggingface_hub accelerate\n","\n","import os, sys, traceback\n","import torch, numpy as np\n","from huggingface_hub import login\n","from transformers import (\n","    AutoTokenizer, AutoModelForCausalLM,\n","    AutoImageProcessor, AutoModelForObjectDetection\n",")\n","\n","device = \"cuda\" if torch.cuda.is_available() else \"cpu\"\n","\n","# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n","# 1) Autenticación segura (NO pegues el token en el código)\n","#    Opción A: establece variable de entorno en Colab:\n","#       %env HUGGING_FACE_HUB_TOKEN=hf_xxx\n","#    Opción B: te pedirá el token con login() (interactivo y seguro)\n","# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n","HF_TOKEN = os.getenv(\"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\")\n","if HF_TOKEN:\n","    print(\"✅ Usando token desde variable de entorno.\")\n","else:\n","    try:\n","        print(\"ℹ️  No hay token en entorno. Se solicitará con login() (puedes omitir si el modelo es público).\")\n","        login()  # pega tu token cuando lo pida\n","        HF_TOKEN = os.getenv(\"HUGGING_FACE_HUB_TOKEN\")  # puede quedar seteado por login; si no, no pasa nada\n","    except Exception as e:\n","        print(\"⚠️  No se pudo iniciar sesión (puede no ser necesario para modelos públicos).\")\n","        HF_TOKEN = None\n","\n","# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n","# 2) Intento #1: cargar LLM privado \"fingerclose/Shelly\" (según tu captura)\n","# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n","LM_ID = \"fingerclose/Shelly\"\n","ran_llm = False\n","try:\n","    print(f\"\\n🔹 Intentando cargar LLM: {LM_ID}\")\n","    tok = AutoTokenizer.from_pretrained(LM_ID, token=HF_TOKEN, use_auth_token=True)\n","    llm = AutoModelForCausalLM.from_pretrained(LM_ID, token=HF_TOKEN, use_auth_token=True).to(device)\n","    messages = [{\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"Who are you?\"}]\n","    inputs = tok.apply_chat_template(\n","        messages, add_generation_prompt=True,\n","        tokenize=True, return_tensors=\"pt\"\n","    ).to(device)\n","\n","    with torch.no_grad():\n","        out = llm.generate(\n","            **inputs, max_new_tokens=60,\n","            do_sample=True, top_p=0.9, temperature=0.7\n","        )\n","    print(\"✅ LLM cargado. Respuesta de prueba:\")\n","    print(tok.decode(out[0][inputs[\"input_ids\"].shape[-1]:], skip_special_tokens=True))\n","    ran_llm = True\n","except Exception as e:\n","    print(f\"❌ No se pudo cargar {LM_ID} como LLM.\")\n","    traceback.print_exc(limit=1, file=sys.stdout)\n","\n","# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n","# 3) Fallback a detección de objetos con DETR (público) si el LLM falló\n","#    Dibuja cajas sobre la imagen 'im' (PIL.Image). Si no existe, te avisa.\n","# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n","if not ran_llm:\n","    print(\"\\n🔄 Fallback: cargando detector público 'facebook/detr-resnet-50'...\")\n","    import matplotlib.pyplot as plt\n","    from PIL import Image\n","\n","    DETR_ID = \"facebook/detr-resnet-50\"\n","    try:\n","        processor = AutoImageProcessor.from_pretrained(DETR_ID)\n","        detector = AutoModelForObjectDetection.from_pretrained(DETR_ID).to(device)\n","\n","        # Usa la imagen 'im' si ya la tienes en el entorno\n","        if 'im' not in globals():\n","            # Si no existe, crea una imagen en blanco como placeholder\n","            print(\"ℹ️ Variable 'im' no encontrada. Carga una imagen PIL en 'im' y vuelve a ejecutar esta celda.\")\n","            # Ejemplo de cómo cargar:\n","            # from PIL import Image\n","            # im = Image.open('/content/tu_imagen.jpg').convert('RGB')\n","        else:\n","            enc = processor(images=im, return_tensors=\"pt\").to(device)\n","            with torch.no_grad():\n","                outputs = detector(**enc)\n","\n","            target_sizes = torch.tensor([im.size[::-1]]).to(device)  # (H, W)\n","            results = processor.post_process_object_detection(\n","                outputs, threshold=0.80, target_sizes=target_sizes\n","            )[0]\n","\n","            plt.imshow(np.array(im)); ax = plt.gca()\n","            drawn = 0\n","            for score, label, box in zip(results[\"scores\"], results[\"labels\"], results[\"boxes\"]):\n","                x0, y0, x1, y1 = box.tolist()\n","                ax.add_patch(plt.Rectangle((x0, y0), x1-x0, y1-y0, fill=False, linewidth=2))\n","                ax.text(x0, y0-5, f\"{detector.config.id2label[int(label)]} {score:.2f}\",\n","                        fontsize=10, bbox=dict(facecolor='white', alpha=0.7, edgecolor='none'))\n","                drawn += 1\n","            plt.axis(\"off\"); plt.title(f\"Detecciones (≥0.80): {drawn}\")\n","            plt.show()\n","            print(\"✅ Detección completada.\")\n","    except Exception as e:\n","        print(\"❌ Error en el fallback de detección.\")\n","        traceback.print_exc(limit=1, file=sys.stdout)\n"]},{"cell_type":"markdown","id":"33f02ff6","metadata":{"id":"33f02ff6"},"source":["\n","## 8) Guardado en Drive (opcional)\n","Guarda el mejor modelo y resultados en tu Drive.\n"]},{"cell_type":"code","execution_count":null,"id":"0b1808d7","metadata":{"id":"0b1808d7"},"outputs":[],"source":["\n","SAVE_TO_DRIVE = False\n","DRIVE_DIR = \"/content/drive/MyDrive/tortugas/outputs\"  # Ajusta tu carpeta\n","files_to_save = [\"best_resnet50_turtles.pt\"]\n","\n","if SAVE_TO_DRIVE and 'drive' in globals():\n","    os.makedirs(DRIVE_DIR, exist_ok=True)\n","    for f in files_to_save:\n","        if os.path.exists(f):\n","            !cp -v \"{f}\" \"{DRIVE_DIR}/\"\n","    print(\"Archivos guardados en:\", DRIVE_DIR)\n","else:\n","    print(\"Define SAVE_TO_DRIVE=True y ajusta DRIVE_DIR para guardar en Drive.\")\n"]}],"metadata":{"colab":{"provenance":[{"file_id":"192n1mZFNv4gkgL5BWkb9p26dKpIpdFA2","timestamp":1758898745745}]},"language_info":{"name":"python"},"kernelspec":{"name":"python3","dis